<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1361773398"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1460234907"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="夜もすがら君を想う"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="藤川千愛"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ライカ (Special Edition)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:40.672"><div begin="00:16.163" end="03:41.072"><p begin="00:16.163" end="00:18.220" itunes:key="L299889">きみの小さな胸にそっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想将脸轻轻埋入你纤瘦的胸膛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no chi i sa na mu ne ni so 't to</span></p><p begin="00:18.319" end="00:20.217" itunes:key="L299890">顔を埋めて眠りたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后就这样随之入眠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka o wo u me te ne mu ri ta i</span></p><p begin="00:20.227" end="00:22.121" itunes:key="L299891">そんなことを口にしたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我说出这样的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ko to wo ku chi ni shi ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:22.220" end="00:24.257" itunes:key="L299892">きみは笑ったんだっけ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会不会笑话我呢?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ha wa ra 't ta n da 'k ke ?</span></p><p begin="00:24.267" end="00:26.208" itunes:key="L299893">東京タワー登ったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我登上了东京塔后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to u kyo u ta wa a no bo 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:26.329" end="00:28.210" itunes:key="L299894">きみの家の方眺めたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眺望你家所在的方向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no i e no ho u na ga me ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:28.221" end="00:30.248" itunes:key="L299895">愛がなんなのかほんの少し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总觉得我在不知不觉之间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ga na n na no ka ho n no su ko shi</span></p><p begin="00:30.258" end="00:33.384" itunes:key="L299896">分かったような気がしたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就对这份爱有了更深的了解</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't ta yo u na ki ga shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="00:33.394" end="00:36.174" itunes:key="L299897">気遣う必要なんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然早就没必要</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki du ka u hi tsu yo u na n te</span></p><p begin="00:36.396" end="00:39.216" itunes:key="L299898">もう疾うにないのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在心中牵挂着你了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u to u ni na i no ni</span></p><p begin="00:39.325" end="00:41.427" itunes:key="L299899">今もベランダで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此时此刻我就在阳台上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma mo be ra n da de su 't te ru n da</span></p><p begin="00:41.437" end="00:42.716" itunes:key="L299900">吸ってるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吸着</span></p><p begin="00:42.838" end="00:44.644" itunes:key="L299901">きみの嫌いな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吸着你讨厌的 你讨厌的香烟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ki ra i na ki mi no ki ra i na ta ba ko wo</span></p><p begin="00:44.754" end="00:50.199" itunes:key="L299902">きみの嫌いな煙草を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你讨厌的烟草</span></p><p begin="00:50.376" end="00:54.227" itunes:key="L299903">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="00:54.343" end="00:58.337" itunes:key="L299904">煙は宙をくゆり消えてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烟雾飘向半空消散不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke mu ri ha chu u wo ku yu ri ki e te ku</span></p><p begin="00:58.442" end="01:02.353" itunes:key="L299905">夜もすがら君を想って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在思念你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo 't te</span></p><p begin="01:02.363" end="01:06.174" itunes:key="L299906">残像にしがみついて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依赖着那道残影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">za n zo u ni shi ga mi tsu i te</span></p><p begin="01:06.435" end="01:10.272" itunes:key="L299907">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="01:10.465" end="01:14.417" itunes:key="L299908">心覚えに慰められて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆在慰藉着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro o bo e ni na gu sa me ra re te</span></p><p begin="01:14.427" end="01:18.237" itunes:key="L299909">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="01:18.247" end="01:22.672" itunes:key="L299910">何が足りなかったんだろうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有什么让我觉得无法满足吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ga ta ri na ka 't ta n da ro u na</span></p><p begin="01:26.143" end="01:28.259" itunes:key="L299911">風邪がうつるから我慢と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为感冒会传染才要忍耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga u tsu ru ka ra ga ma n to</span></p><p begin="01:28.263" end="01:30.279" itunes:key="L299912">口づけを拒んだ君<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拒绝与我亲吻的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku chi du ke wo ko ba n da ki mi</span></p><p begin="01:30.289" end="01:32.241" itunes:key="L299913">愛があるからだからって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正因有爱存在才会如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ga a ru ka ra da ka ra 't te</span></p><p begin="01:32.251" end="01:34.261" itunes:key="L299914">キミは言ってたね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是这么说的啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ha i 't te ta ne</span></p><p begin="01:34.271" end="01:36.171" itunes:key="L299915">商店街のメンチカツ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">商业街的炸肉饼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u te n ga i no me n chi ka tsu</span></p><p begin="01:36.281" end="01:38.220" itunes:key="L299916">美味いけどなんか足りなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然很好吃却也美中不足</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma i ke do na n ka ta ri na ku te</span></p><p begin="01:38.230" end="01:40.229" itunes:key="L299917">愛がなんなのかほんの少し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总觉得我在不知不觉之间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ga na n na no ka ho n no su ko shi</span></p><p begin="01:40.239" end="01:43.270" itunes:key="L299918">分かったような気がしたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就对这份爱有了更深的了解</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't ta yo u na ki ga shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:43.304" end="01:46.214" itunes:key="L299919">怒り咎める誰かは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个会生气责难我的人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ko ri to ga me ru da re ka ha</span></p><p begin="01:46.324" end="01:49.360" itunes:key="L299920">もう横にいないのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明已经不在我的身边了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u yo ko ni i na i no ni</span></p><p begin="01:49.404" end="01:51.414" itunes:key="L299921">今もベランダで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此时此刻我仍在阳台上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma mo be ra n da de su 't te ru n da</span></p><p begin="01:51.424" end="01:52.762" itunes:key="L299922">吸ってるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吸着</span></p><p begin="01:52.883" end="01:54.619" itunes:key="L299923">きみの嫌いな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吸着你讨厌的 你讨厌的香烟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ki ra i na ki mi no ki ra i na ta ba ko wo</span></p><p begin="01:54.789" end="02:00.339" itunes:key="L299924">きみの嫌いな煙草を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你讨厌的烟草</span></p><p begin="02:00.361" end="02:04.280" itunes:key="L299925">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="02:04.391" end="02:08.297" itunes:key="L299926">煙は宙をくゆり消えてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烟雾飘向半空消散不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke mu ri ha chu u wo ku yu ri ki e te ku</span></p><p begin="02:08.302" end="02:12.402" itunes:key="L299927">夜もすがら君を想って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在思念你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo 't te</span></p><p begin="02:12.418" end="02:16.279" itunes:key="L299928">残像にしがみついて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依赖着那道残影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">za n zo u ni shi ga mi tsu i te</span></p><p begin="02:16.301" end="02:20.244" itunes:key="L299929">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="02:20.420" end="02:24.349" itunes:key="L299930">心覚えに慰められて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆在慰藉着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro o bo e ni na gu sa me ra re te</span></p><p begin="02:24.359" end="02:28.319" itunes:key="L299931">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="02:28.412" end="02:32.323" itunes:key="L299932">何が足りなかったんだろうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有什么让我觉得无法满足吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ga ta ri na ka 't ta n da ro u na</span></p><p begin="02:32.333" end="02:36.373" itunes:key="L299933">新しく借りたこの部屋は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我刚租的这个房子里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi ku ka ri ta ko no he ya ha</span></p><p begin="02:36.483" end="02:39.750" itunes:key="L299934">まだ何もなくてさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍空无一物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da na ni mo na ku te sa</span></p><p begin="02:39.760" end="02:43.945" itunes:key="L299935">きみを真似て買ったサボテンが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">学你那样买来的那盆仙人掌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo ma ne te ka 't ta sa bo te n ga</span></p><p begin="02:43.955" end="02:50.675" itunes:key="L299936">すべて見透かしてくれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经看透了我的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te mi su ka shi te ku re te</span></p><p begin="02:50.840" end="02:54.834" itunes:key="L299937">ウーナ タタタタ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呜呐—嗒嗒嗒嗒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u u na ta ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="03:04.321" end="03:08.350" itunes:key="L299938">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="03:08.448" end="03:12.303" itunes:key="L299939">煙は宙をくゆり消えてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烟雾飘向半空消散不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke mu ri ha chu u wo ku yu ri ki e te ku</span></p><p begin="03:12.419" end="03:16.419" itunes:key="L299940">夜もすがら君を想って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在思念你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo 't te</span></p><p begin="03:16.429" end="03:20.160" itunes:key="L299941">残像にしがみついて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依赖着那道残影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">za n zo u ni shi ga mi tsu i te</span></p><p begin="03:20.389" end="03:24.290" itunes:key="L299942">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="03:24.383" end="03:28.272" itunes:key="L299943">心覚えに慰められて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆在慰藉着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro o bo e ni na gu sa me ra re te</span></p><p begin="03:28.383" end="03:32.359" itunes:key="L299944">夜もすがら君を想う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我彻夜都在想你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo mo su ga ra ki mi wo o mo u</span></p><p begin="03:32.369" end="03:36.260" itunes:key="L299945">何が足りなかったんだろうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有什么让我觉得无法满足吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ga ta ri na ka 't ta n da ro u na</span></p><p begin="03:36.370" end="03:41.072" itunes:key="L299946">誰も悪くないのかもね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许这不是任何人的错</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo wa ru ku na i no ka mo ne</span></p></div></body></tt>